        "raisedBy": [
          "accessibility"
        ],
        "recommendation": "Give the control a name, e.g. `aria-label=\"Delete document\"` on the button (or visually hidden text). Its only content is `TrashIcon`, whose `<svg ... aria-hidden=\"true\">` (src/components/icons.tsx:3) is removed from the accessibility tree, so a screen reader user reaching the control hears nothing (or just \"button\") and cannot tell it deletes the document (WCAG 1.1.1 Non-text Content, 4.1.2 Name, Role, Value).",
        "reported": true,
