        "recommendation": "Add an `alt` naming the owner (e.g. `alt={`${ownerName}'s avatar`}`, which needs the owner's name as a prop), or `alt=\"\"` if the owner is named in adjacent text. Without `alt`, screen readers announce the image URL or \"image\", and screen reader users do not learn who owns the document, which the toolbar is meant to show (WCAG 1.1.1 Non-text Content).",
